# Case Study 13: ATM Transaction Sequence Simulation

## Problem Statement
Process a sequence of deposits and withdrawals, maintain a simulated balance, enforce withdrawal limits, reject invalid transactions, and produce a transaction summary.

## Objectives
- Process sequential `"DEPOSIT"` and `"WITHDRAW"` transactions while tracking running balance.
- Enforce positive amount checks, sufficient-balance rules, per-transaction withdrawal caps, and daily withdrawal limits.
- Record all approved and rejected attempts in an audit log and print an end-of-session summary.

## Assumptions
- Opening balance is Rs. 10,000.00.
- Per-transaction withdrawal limit is Rs. 15,000.00 and daily cumulative withdrawal limit is Rs. 25,000.00.
- Transaction amounts $\le 0$ or unrecognized transaction types are rejected without modifying the balance.

## Algorithm
1. Initialize `balance`, `daily_withdrawn = 0.0`, `total_deposited = 0.0`, `approved = 0`, `rejected = 0`, and `audit_log = []`.
2. Loop through each `(txn_type, amount)` tuple in the transaction list.
3. Normalize `txn_type` using string methods (`strip()` and `upper()`) and verify `amount > 0`.
4. If `"DEPOSIT"`, add `amount` to `balance` and `total_deposited`, increment `approved`, and append an `"APPROVED"` tuple to `audit_log`.
5. If `"WITHDRAW"`, check `amount <= per_txn_limit`, `daily_withdrawn + amount <= daily_limit`, and `amount <= balance`; update state if valid, otherwise append a `"REJECTED"` tuple with the specific failure reason.
6. Return `audit_log` and a summary tuple, then print the formatted report.

## Flowchart
```text
[Start]
   |
   v
[Initialize balance, limits, counters & log list]
   |
   v
[For each (txn_type, amount) in sequence]
   |
   +--> (amount <= 0?) --Yes--> [Log REJECTED: non-positive amount]
   |         |
   |         No
   +--> (txn_type == "DEPOSIT"?) --Yes--> [Update balance, log APPROVED]
   |         |
   |         No
   +--> (txn_type == "WITHDRAW"?)
             |--(violates limit or balance?)--> [Log REJECTED with reason]
             |--(valid)-----------------------> [Deduct balance, update daily_withdrawn, log APPROVED]
   |
   v
[Print audit log & summary tuple]
   |
   v
[Stop]
```

## Pseudocode
```text
BEGIN
    balance = 10000.0
    per_txn_limit = 15000.0
    daily_limit = 25000.0
    daily_withdrawn = 0.0
    total_deposited = 0.0
    approved = 0
    rejected = 0
    audit_log = []

    FOR each (raw_type, amt) IN transactions DO
        kind = UPPER(TRIM(raw_type))
        IF amt <= 0 THEN
            rejected = rejected + 1
            APPEND ("REJECTED", kind, amt, "Amount must be greater than zero", balance) TO audit_log
        ELSE IF kind == "DEPOSIT" THEN
            balance = balance + amt
            total_deposited = total_deposited + amt
            approved = approved + 1
            APPEND ("APPROVED", kind, amt, "Deposit credited", balance) TO audit_log
        ELSE IF kind == "WITHDRAW" THEN
            IF amt > per_txn_limit THEN
                rejected = rejected + 1
                APPEND ("REJECTED", kind, amt, "Exceeds per-txn limit", balance) TO audit_log
            ELSE IF (daily_withdrawn + amt) > daily_limit THEN
                rejected = rejected + 1
                APPEND ("REJECTED", kind, amt, "Exceeds daily limit", balance) TO audit_log
            ELSE IF amt > balance THEN
                rejected = rejected + 1
                APPEND ("REJECTED", kind, amt, "Insufficient funds", balance) TO audit_log
            ELSE
                balance = balance - amt
                daily_withdrawn = daily_withdrawn + amt
                approved = approved + 1
                APPEND ("APPROVED", kind, amt, "Withdrawal dispensed", balance) TO audit_log
            END IF
        ELSE
            rejected = rejected + 1
            APPEND ("REJECTED", kind, amt, "Unsupported transaction type", balance) TO audit_log
        END IF
    END FOR

    PRINT audit_log and summary
END
```



## Test Cases
| Test Case | Transaction Input | Expected Status & Balance |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| TC-1 (Valid deposit) | `("deposit", 5000.0)` | `APPROVED` $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 15000.00` |
| TC-2 (Per-txn cap) | `("withdraw", 18000.0)` | `REJECTED` (Exceeds Rs. 15,000 limit) $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 15000.00` |
| TC-3 (Valid withdrawal) | `("withdraw", 12000.0)` | `APPROVED` $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 3000.00`, Daily withdrawn `Rs. 12000.00` |
| TC-4 (Daily cap) | `("withdraw", 14000.0)` | `REJECTED` (`12000 + 14000 > 25000`) $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 3000.00` |
| TC-5 (Insufficient funds) | `("withdraw", 5000.0)` | `REJECTED` (`5000 > 3000`) $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 3000.00` |
| TC-6 (Invalid amount) | `("withdraw", -100.0)` | `REJECTED` (Non-positive amount) $\rightarrow$ Balance `Rs. 3000.00` |

